  "_about": "a dog SCULPTED on its rig (2026-11-05, gen: scratchpad sc/carn/gen/canids.py): a medium farm dog -- a deep chest and tucked waist, a broad skull with a marked stop over a blunt muzzle, drop ears; its coats (species.js coatDef) recolour the same keys (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The DROP EARS (ears2.py): one sheet each (sharp.js `fin`) out of the top of the skull, hanging down the side of the head, the hollow toward it, the root faired. (2026-11-08, dropear.py) The DROP EARS stood off the skin: ears2.py had measured them from the old field shapes inside the head, the rear rim up to 14 mm under the skin, so only a sliver of the flap showed; each outline point is moved along the field normal to stand 4 mm clear at the root to 14 mm at the tip, the root still buried. WHISKERS (2026-11-08, tools/creaturegen/sharp/whiskers.py): 9 dark brown whiskers a side, 3 rows on the whisker pad (30-45 mm) -- `whiskers` shapes (bodyspec.js whiskerStrands: thin pointed strands, mirrored, on the head, near mesh only; details, so every coat and variant still shares one mesh). (2026-11-08, tools/creaturegen/sweep/tails.py) The TAIL is one `sweep` (sculpt.js) along its bones, not a chain of cones blended one into the next: no beads, its thin end exact rings. (2026-11-08) The tail's root is set 2 cm into the rump and blended at k .028: it grows out of the rump, not off a disc.",
